Dear Prime Minister and Sir Mark,

Please find attached my open correspondence dated 21 September 2026, The Re=
cord Exists =97 Preservation and Independent Verification of the Primary Tr=
ial Record.

I have now obtained the complete official transcript record of the February=
 2024 final hearing: six transcripts comprising 496 pages. The transcripts =
have been assigned permanent evidential references and incorporated into Th=
e Saghro Files =97 Independent Evidential Reconstruction. As set out in the=
 attached statement, the findings arising from the trial can now be tested =
systematically against the official oral record.

I am also transmitting the source-based catalogue of 25 references derived =
from the transcripts and selected existing analytical reports. Those report=
s pre-date my obtaining the complete official transcript record and will no=
w be tested against it as part of the forensic reconstruction.

From today, The Daily Saghro will also maintain a public record of observab=
le institutional response, including where no observable response or change=
 occurs.

Please acknowledge receipt of this email and the attachments listed below.

Yours sincerely,
Nadia Zahmoul
The Saghro Files
Independent Evidential Reconstruction
X: @SaghroProject<https://x.com/SaghroProject>

Attachments

